# Project Rules

- Canonical docs: `README.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `docs/explanation/scope-contract.md`, `docs/workflow.md`.
- **NeNe Suite = installer/orchestrator only** (ADR 0002). Not a domain application.
- Do NOT vendor sibling product source or merge product repos into this tree.
- Do NOT add billing, CMS, archive, CSV, or reconciliation domain logic here.
- Issue-driven workflow; English repository docs; no secrets in git.
- When docs and Cursor rules conflict, update docs first and keep rules concise.
